	<span>
		<strong>Ethics and Safety</strong>
	</span>
</h2>
<p>As open models become central to enterprise infrastructure, provenance a=
nd security are paramount. Developed by Google DeepMind, Gemma 4 undergoes =
the same rigorous safety evaluations as our proprietary Gemini models. </p>
